# 2026-08-21  1.2.1     Literally Some Cat  Corrected debug output.
# 2026-09-01  2.0.0     Literally Some Cat  Moved app autostart to functions.
# 2026-09-02  2.1.0     Literally Some Cat  Moved picom to systemd kinda.
